# Changelog files are append-only bullet lists. Parallel feature branches each
# add entries to the end of the same section, which conflicts on every merge
# even though the changes never contradict each other. The union merge driver
# keeps both sides' lines instead of raising a conflict.
#
# Caveat: union merges silently, so it will NOT flag the one case that needs a
# human — two branches each creating the same new "# YYYY.N" version heading,
# which yields a duplicate heading. Check the top of the file after a merge
# that lands on a version bump.
ReleaseNotes.md merge=union
Changelog.md    merge=union
